          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo iyagu waxay ku xadgudbeen Ilaahii awowayaashood, oo sidii naag ninkeedii ka dhillowday ayay raaceen ilaahyadii dadkii dalka degganaa, oo Ilaah hortooda ku baabbi'iyey. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.5.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.5.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 5:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo markaasaa Ilaah wuxuu kiciyey boqorkii Ashuur ee Fuul ahaa, kaasoo ahaa boqorkii Ashuur oo Tilgad Filneser ahaa, oo isna iyagii buu kaxaystay xataa reer Ruubeen, iyo reer Gaad, iyo qabiilkii reer Manaseh badhkiis, oo wuxuu iyagii geeyey Xalax, iyo Xaaboor, iyo Haaraa, iyo tan iyo webiga Goosaan, oo halkaasay joogaan ilaa maantadan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.5.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.5.26"
            ]
          }
        }
